<title>UK: MOODY'S - MAJOR HUNGARIAN BANKS' OUTLOOK POSITIVE.</title>
<headline>MOODY'S - MAJOR HUNGARIAN BANKS' OUTLOOK POSITIVE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's rating agency said on Thursday that the credit outlook for major Hungarian banks was positive.</p>
<p>However, it said that although the situation was improving, Hungary's economic transformation to a market system was incomplete, and &quot;further enterprise shake-out is likely&quot;.</p>
</text>
